        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "舞台の上で役者が打ち棒を振り回すと、会場は大きな笑いに包まれた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "昔ながらの喜劇では、打ち棒を使ったコミカルな立ち回りが定番だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は打ち棒を手に、ピエロのような滑稽な動きで観客を沸かせた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
